@startuml "Use Case Diagram"
left to right direction

Actor Student
Actor Instructor

rectangle "System" {
    "Verify Lecture In Session" as (inSession)

    "Start Lecture" as (Lecture)

    "Start Transcription" as (Start)
    "End Transcription" as (End)
    "Request Summary" as (Summary)

    "Ask Question" as (Ask)
    "Raise Hand" as (Raise)
}

Instructor -- Lecture
Instructor -- Start
Instructor -- End
Instructor -- Summary

Student -- Summary
Student -- Ask
Student -- Raise

Start ..> inSession: <<extends>>
Summary ..> inSession : <<extends>>
Raise ..> inSession: <<extends>>
Ask ..> inSession: <<extends>>


@enduml